# Google Maps (optional — without these the site renders the keyless MapLibre map)
#
# Setup in https://console.cloud.google.com:
#   1. Create a project (e.g. "orol-website") and enable billing.
#   2. APIs & Services → enable "Maps JavaScript API".
#   3. Credentials → Create API key. Restrict it to HTTP referrers:
#      your production domain + http://localhost:5173/*
#   4. Google Maps Platform → Map Styles → create a style:
#      roads #c0281c, landscape #ffffff, water #e2e6e8, POI density off.
#   5. Map Management → create a Map ID (JavaScript / vector),
#      associate the style with it.
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in:
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_KEY=
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_MAP_ID=
